OL,3,CPlane engineer dies after maintenance
OL,4,Cwork incident at Heathrow Airport
OL,6,FA 23-year-old engineer has died nearly
OL,7,Fa month after he suffered injuries
OL,8,Fwhile undertaking maintenance work on
OL,9,Fan aircraft at Heathrow Airport,
OL,10,Fpolice have said.
OL,12,FOfficers were called at 8.49am on June
OL,13,F11 to reports that a man had been
OL,14,Finjured at Heathrow Airport, the
OL,15,FMetropolitan Police said on Tuesday.
OL,17,FGeorgie Buxton, who was employed by
OL,18,FVirgin Atlantic, was taken to hospital
OL,19,Ffor treatment to serious injuries, but
OL,20,Fdied on July 7.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/4
