OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1785334695
OL,3,CPlane engineer dies after maintenance
OL,4,Cwork incident at Heathrow Airport
OL,6,FOfficers from the Met's Aviation
OL,7,FPolicing Unit and the Health and
OL,8,FSafety Executive (HSE) are
OL,9,Finvestigating the incident, the force
OL,10,Fadded.
OL,12,FA Virgin Atlantic spokesperson said in
OL,13,Fa statement on Tuesday: "We are
OL,14,Fheartbroken to confirm that a much-
OL,15,Floved member of our engineering team
OL,16,Fhas passed away.
OL,18,F"Our thoughts are firmly with
OL,19,FGeorgie's family, loved ones, friends
OL,20,Fand colleagues at this incredibly sad
OL,21,Fand challenging time.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/4
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
