OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1785334695
OL,3,CPlane engineer dies after maintenance
OL,4,Cwork incident at Heathrow Airport
OL,6,F"We are working closely with relevant
OL,7,Fauthorities and the aircraft
OL,8,Fmanufacturer on the investigation to
OL,9,Festablish all facts.
OL,11,F"Out of respect for those involved and
OL,12,Fwhile the investigation is ongoing, we
OL,13,Fare unable to provide any further
OL,14,Finformation at this stage."
